message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Mingyue Wanxiang: Renewable Energy Forecasting Agent from Model Selection to Long-Term Operation"
abstract: >-
  Mingyue Wanxiang is a renewable energy output forecasting system for photovoltaic and
  wind sites. It couples a modeling engine — which answers which model a site should use
  through reproducible rolling evaluation over statistical, machine-learning, deep-learning
  and time-series foundation models — with a runtime system that governs long-term
  operation through task tracks, release gates, asset governance and an append-only audit
  ledger.
type: software
authors:
